{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01173",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.29,
      "end_seconds": 7.05,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "Doctor, hi, where would you like me to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.98,
      "end_seconds": 12.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "of course, leave it there how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.49,
      "end_seconds": 20.5,
      "duration_seconds": 7.01,
      "text": "Yeah, it's pain going into my left arm. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.44,
      "end_seconds": 25.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Right, did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.14,
      "end_seconds": 30.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "I've had it for ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.27,
      "end_seconds": 35.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Rate it it for me, mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.76,
      "end_seconds": 38.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "I'd say severe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.98,
      "end_seconds": 41.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Sure. Is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.56,
      "end_seconds": 58.89,
      "duration_seconds": 15.33,
      "text": "Crushing chest pain goes along with it, most of the time. As for Crushing chest pain, it's a few times a day. Exertion definitely sets it off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.38,
      "end_seconds": 76.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.86,
      "end_seconds": 81.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Not to my knowledge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.99,
      "end_seconds": 85.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "what operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.13,
      "end_seconds": 89.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Just a triple bypass, eight years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.96,
      "end_seconds": 94.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "So, anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.83,
      "end_seconds": 99.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.77,
      "end_seconds": 102.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.4,
      "end_seconds": 105.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.53,
      "end_seconds": 111.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.1,
      "end_seconds": 118.55,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure, yes. I've had heart disease, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.12,
      "end_seconds": 121.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "is that everything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.83,
      "end_seconds": 130.69,
      "duration_seconds": 7.86,
      "text": "So, do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.25,
      "end_seconds": 137.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "I'm on telmisartan, once a day for my pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.63,
      "end_seconds": 140.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "And what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.48,
      "end_seconds": 148.8,
      "duration_seconds": 7.32,
      "text": "It's 40 milligrams. I'm on clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day for the stent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.53,
      "end_seconds": 168.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Have you had any fever, leg swelling or cough?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.72,
      "end_seconds": 176.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "No fever, leg swelling or cough, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.44,
      "end_seconds": 179.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.32,
      "end_seconds": 182.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "no changes there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.48,
      "end_seconds": 185.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.34,
      "end_seconds": 188.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "no, all normal there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.54,
      "end_seconds": 193.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.09,
      "end_seconds": 213.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.23,
      "end_seconds": 216.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.31,
      "end_seconds": 235.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "you are pale and sweaty, and your pulse is fast"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.47,
      "end_seconds": 256.0,
      "duration_seconds": 14.53,
      "text": "Please sit back down. From what you've told me and what I found, it fits best with a possible heart attack. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.52,
      "end_seconds": 259.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.11,
      "end_seconds": 284.53,
      "duration_seconds": 23.42,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a possible heart attack, but I'd like to confirm. I want a troponin blood test done, that's for chest pain. I'd like to arrange an ECG for chest pain. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.25,
      "end_seconds": 286.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "That makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.98,
      "end_seconds": 305.76,
      "duration_seconds": 17.78,
      "text": "Stay lying down and do not eat or drink. I'll also refer you to the cardiac team. Please don't wait if the pain returns. That's when to be seen urgently. Come back straight away. Right, I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.16,
      "end_seconds": 310.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Hmm, I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.99,
      "end_seconds": 313.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "see you soon"
    }
  ]
}